@* 🟢 يقابل شاشتين أصليتين بنفس الفكرة (قائمة فواتير + مدفوعات الفاتورة المحددة)، صفحة واحدة بالباراميتر ?mode:
     - (بدون mode) Accounts.InvoicesFrm.invoices.Invoices_List_Payment_  (menuItem "عرض مدفوعات الفواتير"): الاستعلام
       InvoicesClss.Get_Customers_Invoices (المدفوع = صافى Money_Transaction_Box لكل فاتورة، المتبقى = الصافى - المدفوع) بفلاتر رقم الفاتورة/
       العميل/التواريخ/نوع الفاتورة (الكل-آجل-نقدى)/حالة السداد (الكل-مسددة-غير مسددة)/البائع؛ ومدفوعات الفاتورة المحددة عبر
       Money_Transaction_BoxOrderReportCLS.GetMoney_Box_TransactionInvoices.
     - ?mode=distribution  Accounts.Requests.ReceiptDistribution.Invoices_List_ReceiptDistributionReport ("أرصدة الفواتير - مدفوعات وتوزيع
       نقدية" و"متابعة فواتير المبيعات المستحقة" - العنصران فى القائمة يفتحان نفس الفورم بلا أى معامل): وضع البحث فقط (IsOnlySearch=true)
       عبر InvoicesClss.Get_Customers_InvoicesForDistributeMoney (المدفوع من جدول التوزيع Money_Transaction_BoxForInvoices)، ومدفوعات الفاتورة
       عبر GetMoney_Box_TransactionForInvoicesDistribut. عمود تاريخ الاستحقاق يظهر فقط لمن لديه صلاحية القائمة 957
       (Common.IsShowInvoices_List_WithDueDate) - يُقرأ هنا من قوائم المستخدم الحالى بدل Common.User_Id الثابت (متعدد المستخدمين).
       ?view=due لا يغيّر السلوك (عنصر قائمة ثانٍ لنفس الفورم) بل عنوان الصفحة فقط.

   خطة المتبقى ج1–ج3: وضع ?mode=distribution صار يكتب أيضاً: اختيار إذن قبض (Cash_Money_ListFromCustomersToSelect) ثم توزيع مبلغه على فواتير
   عميله وحفظه/حذفه عبر ReceiptDistributionService (SaveUpdate/DeleteMoney_Transaction_BoxForInvoice الأصليتين)؛ وزر "إذن نقدية" لكل فاتورة
   (MakeOrderMoneyNowMulti) يفتح صفحة إذن الطرف مربوطاً بالفاتورة، والنقر المزدوج على سطر المدفوعات يفتح الإذن (/accounts/cash/voucher).
   مؤجَّل: الطباعة (RDLC). فلاتر "تاريخ الاستحقاق" و"نوع العميل" فى الأصل لا تؤثر على الاستعلام أصلاً فلم تُنقل. *@
@page "/accounts/invoices/payments"

@using System.Data
@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountModelsLib.Models
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@inject MenuStateService MenuState
@inject ISnackbar Snackbar
@inject IDialogService Dialog
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@_title</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4" Elevation="1">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Color="Color.Primary" Class="font-weight-bold mb-4">@_title</MudText>

        <MudGrid Spacing="3">
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudNumericField T="long?" @bind-Value="_invoiceNo" Label="@Tr("InvoiceNoLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" HideSpinButtons="true"
                                 Immediate="true" OnKeyDown="OnInvoiceNoKeyDownAsync" Format="0" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudAutocomplete T="LookupOption" @bind-Value="_customer" SearchFunc="SearchCustomersAsync" ToStringFunc="@(c => c?.Name ?? "")"
                                 Label="@Tr("CustomerLabel")" Placeholder="@Tr("AllCustomers")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                                 Clearable="true" CoerceText="false" ResetValueOnEmptyText="true" MaxItems="50" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudStack Row="true" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Spacing="1">
                    <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_useFrom" Dense="true" Size="Size.Small" />
                    <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_dateFrom" Label="@Tr("DateFromLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="@(!_useFrom)" />
                </MudStack>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudStack Row="true" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Spacing="1">
                    <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_useTo" Dense="true" Size="Size.Small" />
                    <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_dateTo" Label="@Tr("DateToLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="@(!_useTo)" />
                </MudStack>
            </MudItem>
            @if (_showDueDate)
            {
                <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                    <MudStack Row="true" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Spacing="1">
                        <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_useDueFrom" Dense="true" Size="Size.Small" />
                        <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_dueFrom" Label="@(Tr("PmtDueDateColumn") + " - " + Tr("DateFromLabel"))" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="@(!_useDueFrom)" />
                    </MudStack>
                </MudItem>
                <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                    <MudStack Row="true" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Spacing="1">
                        <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_useDueTo" Dense="true" Size="Size.Small" />
                        <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_dueTo" Label="@(Tr("PmtDueDateColumn") + " - " + Tr("DateToLabel"))" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="@(!_useDueTo)" />
                    </MudStack>
                </MudItem>
            }
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudSelect T="int" @bind-Value="_invoiceKind" Label="@Tr("PmtInvoiceKindLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" FullWidth="true">
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="-1">@Tr("PmtAllOption")</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="1">@Tr("PmtCreditOption")</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="0">@Tr("PmtCashOption")</MudSelectItem>
                </MudSelect>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudSelect T="int" @bind-Value="_paidStatus" Label="@Tr("PmtStatusLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" FullWidth="true">
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="-1">@Tr("PmtAllOption")</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="1">@Tr("PmtPaidOption")</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="0">@Tr("PmtUnpaidOption")</MudSelectItem>
                </MudSelect>
            </MudItem>
            @if (!_isDistribution)
            {
                <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                    <MudAutocomplete T="LookupOption" @bind-Value="_seller" SearchFunc="SearchSellersAsync" ToStringFunc="@(c => c?.Name ?? "")"
                                     Label="@Tr("PmtSellerLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Clearable="true" CoerceText="false"
                                     ResetValueOnEmptyText="true" MaxItems="50" />
                </MudItem>
            }
        </MudGrid>

        <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="2" Class="mt-3">
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search"
                       OnClick="@(() => SearchAsync(false))" Disabled="@_isLoading">
                @Tr("SearchButton")
            </MudButton>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Secondary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.OpenInNew"
                       OnClick="OpenSelected" Disabled="@(_selectedId == null)">
                @Tr("ShowInvoiceButton")
            </MudButton>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Add"
                       OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo("/accounts/invoices/sales-invoice"))">
                @Tr("NewInvoiceButton")
            </MudButton>
        </MudStack>
    </MudPaper>

    @if (_isDistribution)
    {
        <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4" Elevation="1">
            <MudStack Row="true" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Justify="Justify.SpaceBetween" Wrap="Wrap.Wrap" Spacing="2">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="font-weight-bold">@Tr("RD_PickTitle")</MudText>
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ReceiptLong" OnClick="@(() => _pickerOpen = !_pickerOpen)">
                    @Tr("RD_SearchReceipts")
                </MudButton>
            </MudStack>

            @if (_voucher == null)
            {
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mud-text-secondary mt-2">@Tr("RD_HintPick")</MudText>
            }
            else
            {
                <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="mt-3">@Tr("RD_Selected", _voucher.OrderNo, _voucher.Customer)</MudAlert>
                <MudGrid Class="mt-2" Spacing="2">
                    <MudItem xs="6" sm="3"><MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("RD_ReceiptValue")</MudText><MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@_voucher.Value.ToString("N2")</MudText></MudItem>
                    <MudItem xs="6" sm="3"><MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("RD_TotalApplied")</MudText><MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@AppliedTotal.ToString("N2")</MudText></MudItem>
                    <MudItem xs="6" sm="3">
                        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("RD_RestOfReceipt")</MudText>
                        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Color="@(ReceiptRest < 0 ? Color.Error : Color.Default)">@ReceiptRest.ToString("N2")</MudText>
                    </MudItem>
                    <MudItem xs="6" sm="3"><MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("PmtBankColumn")</MudText><MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1">@_voucher.Bank</MudText></MudItem>
                </MudGrid>
                <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="2" Class="mt-3" Wrap="Wrap.Wrap">
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Success" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Save" OnClick="SaveDistributionAsync"
                               Disabled="@(_isBusy || ReceiptRest < 0)">@Tr("RD_Save")</MudButton>
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Error" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.DeleteOutline" OnClick="DeleteDistributionAsync"
                               Disabled="@(_isBusy || _voucher.Allocated <= 0)">@Tr("RD_Delete")</MudButton>
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Text" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ClearAll" OnClick="ClearAllocations">@Tr("RD_ClearAll")</MudButton>
                </MudStack>
            }

            @if (_pickerOpen)
            {
                <MudDivider Class="my-3" />
                <MudGrid Spacing="2">
                    <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="4">
                        <MudAutocomplete T="LookupOption" @bind-Value="_rcCustomer" SearchFunc="SearchCustomersAsync" ToStringFunc="@(c => c?.Name ?? "")"
                                         Label="@Tr("CustomerLabel")" Placeholder="@Tr("AllCustomers")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                                         Clearable="true" CoerceText="false" ResetValueOnEmptyText="true" MaxItems="50" />
                    </MudItem>
                    <MudItem xs="6" md="3"><MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_rcFrom" Label="@Tr("DateFromLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Clearable="true" /></MudItem>
                    <MudItem xs="6" md="3"><MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_rcTo" Label="@Tr("DateToLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Clearable="true" /></MudItem>
                    <MudItem xs="12" md="2" Class="d-flex align-center">
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" FullWidth="true" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search"
                                   OnClick="SearchReceiptsAsync" Disabled="@_receiptsLoading">@Tr("SearchButton")</MudButton>
                    </MudItem>
                </MudGrid>
                <MudTable Items="@_receipts" T="ReceiptDistributionService.ReceiptRow" Hover="true" Striped="true" Dense="true" Elevation="0" Class="mt-3"
                          Loading="@_receiptsLoading" Bordered="true">
                    <HeaderContent>
                        <MudTh>@Tr("RD_ReceiptNo")</MudTh>
                        <MudTh>@Tr("DateColumn")</MudTh>
                        <MudTh>@Tr("CustomerLabel")</MudTh>
                        <MudTh>@Tr("RD_BankLabel")</MudTh>
                        <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("RD_ReceiptValue")</MudTh>
                        <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("RD_AllocatedCol")</MudTh>
                        <MudTh></MudTh>
                    </HeaderContent>
                    <RowTemplate>
                        <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("RD_ReceiptNo")">@context.OrderNo</MudTd>
                        <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("DateColumn")">@FormatDate(context.Date)</MudTd>
                        <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("CustomerLabel")">@context.Customer</MudTd>
                        <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("RD_BankLabel")">@context.Bank</MudTd>
                        <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("RD_ReceiptValue")" Style="text-align:end;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">@context.Value.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
                        <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("RD_AllocatedCol")" Style="text-align:end;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">@context.Allocated.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
                        <MudTd><MudButton Size="Size.Small" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" OnClick="@(() => SelectReceiptAsync(context))">@Tr("RD_Select")</MudButton></MudTd>
                    </RowTemplate>
                    <NoRecordsContent>
                        <MudText Align="Align.Center" Class="py-3 mud-text-secondary">@(_receiptsSearched ? Tr("RD_NoReceipts") : Tr("PressSearchHint"))</MudText>
                    </NoRecordsContent>
                </MudTable>
            }
        </MudPaper>
    }

    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_errorMessage))
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" Class="mb-4">@_errorMessage</MudAlert>
    }

    <MudGrid Class="mb-4">
        <MudItem xs="6" sm="3">
            <MudPaper Class="pa-3 text-center" Elevation="0" Outlined="true">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("InvoicesCountLabel")</MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@_rows.Count</MudText>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>
        <MudItem xs="6" sm="3">
            <MudPaper Class="pa-3 text-center" Elevation="0" Outlined="true">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("NetTotalSumLabel")</MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@_netSum.ToString("N2")</MudText>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>
        <MudItem xs="6" sm="3">
            <MudPaper Class="pa-3 text-center" Elevation="0" Outlined="true">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("PmtPaidSumLabel")</MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@_paidSum.ToString("N2")</MudText>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>
        <MudItem xs="6" sm="3">
            <MudPaper Class="pa-3 text-center" Elevation="0" Outlined="true" Style="background-color:var(--mud-palette-info-lighten);">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">@Tr("PmtRemainingSumLabel")</MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@_remainingSum.ToString("N2")</MudText>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>
    </MudGrid>

    <MudTable Items="@_rows" T="InvoiceRow" Hover="true" Striped="true" Bordered="true" Dense="true" Elevation="1" Loading="@_isLoading"
              RowClassFunc="@((InvoiceRow row, int index) => row.Id == _selectedId ? "mud-selected-item" : string.Empty)"
              OnRowClick="@((TableRowClickEventArgs<InvoiceRow> e) => SelectInvoiceAsync(e.Item))">
        <HeaderContent>
            <MudTh>@Tr("SerialColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("CustomerLabel")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("InvoiceNoLabel")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("DateColumn")</MudTh>
            @if (_showDueDate)
            {
                <MudTh>@Tr("PmtDueDateColumn")</MudTh>
            }
            <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("NetTotalColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("PmtPaidColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("PmtRemainingColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("NotesColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("UserColumn")</MudTh>
            @if (_voucher != null)
            {
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end;min-width:150px">@Tr("RD_PayCol")</MudTh>
            }
            <MudTh></MudTh>
        </HeaderContent>
        <RowTemplate>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SerialColumn")">@context.Serial</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("CustomerLabel")">@context.Customer</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("InvoiceNoLabel")">@context.InvoiceNo</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("DateColumn")">@FormatDate(context.Date)</MudTd>
            @if (_showDueDate)
            {
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("PmtDueDateColumn")">@FormatDate(context.DueDate)</MudTd>
            }
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NetTotalColumn")" Style="text-align:end;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">@context.Net.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("PmtPaidColumn")" Style="text-align:end;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">@context.Paid.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("PmtRemainingColumn")" Style="@($"text-align:end;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;{(context.Remaining > 0 ? "color:var(--mud-palette-error);font-weight:600;" : "")}")">@context.Remaining.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NotesColumn")">@context.Notes</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("UserColumn")">@context.User</MudTd>
            @if (_voucher != null)
            {
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("RD_PayCol")" Style="text-align:end">
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;justify-content:flex-end" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                        <MudNumericField T="decimal?" Value="@GetAlloc(context.Id)" ValueChanged="@((decimal? v) => SetAlloc(context, v))" Min="0" Max="@context.Remaining"
                                         Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense" HideSpinButtons="true" Immediate="true" Format="N2" Style="max-width:130px"
                                         Disabled="@(context.Remaining <= 0 && (GetAlloc(context.Id) ?? 0) == 0)" aria-label="@Tr("RD_PayCol")" />
                        <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.PlaylistAddCheck" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Primary" title="@Tr("RD_FillRest")" aria-label="@Tr("RD_FillRest")"
                                       OnClick="@(() => FillRest(context))" Disabled="@(context.Remaining <= 0)" />
                    </div>
                </MudTd>
            }
            <MudTd>
                <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.OpenInNew" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Primary"
                               OnClick="@(() => Open(context.Id))" title="@Tr("ShowInvoiceButton")" aria-label="@Tr("ShowInvoiceButton")" />
                <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Payments" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Success"
                               OnClick="@(() => OpenCashVoucher(context.Id))" title="@Tr("InvCashVoucherButton")" aria-label="@Tr("InvCashVoucherButton")" />
            </MudTd>
        </RowTemplate>
        <NoRecordsContent>
            <MudText Align="Align.Center" Class="py-4 mud-text-secondary">@(_searched ? Tr("NoRecordsFound") : Tr("PressSearchHint"))</MudText>
        </NoRecordsContent>
    </MudTable>

    @if (_selectedId != null)
    {
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-6 mb-2 font-weight-bold">@Tr("PmtPaymentsOfInvoiceTitle")</MudText>
        <MudTable Items="@_payments" T="PaymentRow" Hover="true" Striped="true" Bordered="true" Dense="true" Elevation="1" Loading="@_isPaymentsLoading"
                  OnRowClick="@((TableRowClickEventArgs<PaymentRow> e) => OpenVoucher(e.Item.OrderId))">
            <HeaderContent>
                <MudTh>@Tr("SerialColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("PmtReceiptNoColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("DateColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("PmtBankColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("NameColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("PmtImportColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("PmtExportColumn")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("NotesColumn")</MudTh>
            </HeaderContent>
            <RowTemplate>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SerialColumn")">@context.Serial</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("PmtReceiptNoColumn")">@context.OrderNo</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("DateColumn")">@FormatDate(context.Date)</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("PmtBankColumn")">@context.Bank</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NameColumn")">@context.Name</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("PmtImportColumn")" Style="text-align:end;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">@context.Import.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("PmtExportColumn")" Style="text-align:end;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">@context.Export.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NotesColumn")">@context.Notes</MudTd>
            </RowTemplate>
            <NoRecordsContent>
                <MudText Align="Align.Center" Class="py-3 mud-text-secondary">@Tr("NoRecordsFound")</MudText>
            </NoRecordsContent>
        </MudTable>
    }
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private record LookupOption(long Id, string Name);
    private record InvoiceRow(long Id, int Serial, string Customer, long InvoiceNo, DateTime? Date, DateTime? DueDate, decimal Net, decimal Paid,
                              decimal Remaining, string Notes, string User);
    private record PaymentRow(long OrderId, int Serial, string OrderNo, DateTime? Date, string Bank, string Name, decimal Import, decimal Export, string Notes);

    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "mode")] public string? ModeQuery { get; set; }
    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "view")] public string? ViewQuery { get; set; }

    private readonly CustomerCLS _customerCls = new();
    private readonly ReceiptDistributionService _distSvc = new();

    // توزيع إذن قبض (?mode=distribution): الإذن المختار والمبالغ المسددة لكل فاتورة (Invoices_List.Id ← مبلغ)
    private ReceiptDistributionService.ReceiptRow? _voucher;
    private readonly Dictionary<long, decimal?> _alloc = new();
    private bool _pickerOpen, _receiptsLoading, _receiptsSearched, _isBusy;
    private List<ReceiptDistributionService.ReceiptRow> _receipts = new();
    private LookupOption? _rcCustomer;
    private DateTime? _rcFrom = DateTime.Now.Date.AddDays(-30);
    private DateTime? _rcTo = DateTime.Now.Date;
    private decimal AppliedTotal => _alloc.Values.Sum(v => v ?? 0);
    private decimal ReceiptRest => (_voucher?.Value ?? 0) - AppliedTotal;

    private bool _isDistribution;
    private bool _showDueDate;
    private bool _useDueFrom, _useDueTo;
    private DateTime? _dueFrom = DateTime.Now.Date, _dueTo = DateTime.Now.Date;
    private string _title = "";

    private long? _invoiceNo;
    private LookupOption? _customer;
    private LookupOption? _seller;
    private bool _useFrom = true;
    private bool _useTo = true;
    private DateTime? _dateFrom = DateTime.Now.Date;
    private DateTime? _dateTo = DateTime.Now.Date;
    private int _invoiceKind = -1;
    private int _paidStatus = -1;

    private List<InvoiceRow> _rows = new();
    private List<PaymentRow> _payments = new();
    private decimal _netSum;
    private decimal _paidSum;
    private decimal _remainingSum;
